setup stay
wait 2200
expect-setup cli Passed 4
setup skip
expect-setup cli Passed 4
setup next
expect-setup daemon NeedsAction 4
setup skip
expect-setup docker Passed 4
expect-setup routing Unchecked 4
setup skip
expect-setup trust Unchecked 4
setup skip
expect-setup login NeedsAction 4
setup skip
expect-setup done 4
setup finish
expect-setup closed 4
quit
